{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWM_SECTION_6_Requirements_Tracing","src":"manifest","doc":"SWS_BSWModeManager","page":21,"text":"6 Requirements Tracing\nThe following tables reference the requirements specified in [3] and [4] and links to the\nfulfillment of these. Please note that if column \"Satisfied by\" is empty for a specific\nrequirement this means that this requirement is not fulfilled by this document.\nRequirement\nDescription\nSatisfied by\n[SRS_BSW_00003]\nAll software modules shall provide\nversion and identification information\n[SWS_BswM_00003]\n[SRS_BSW_00101]\nThe Basic Software Module shall be\nable to initialize variables and\nhardware in a separate initialization\nfunction\n[SWS_BswM_00002] [SWS_BswM_00043]\n[SWS_BswM_00044] [SWS_BswM_00261]\n[SRS_BSW_00167]\nAll AUTOSAR Basic Software\nModules shall provide configuration\nrules and constraints to enable\nplausibility checks\n[SWS_BswM_00240] [SWS_BswM_00242]\n[SWS_BswM_00243] [SWS_BswM_00256]\n[SRS_BSW_00301]\nAll AUTOSAR Basic Software\nModules shall only import the\nnecessary information\n[SWS_BswM_00001] [SWS_BswM_00237]\n[SWS_BswM_00279]\n[SRS_BSW_00305]\nData types naming convention\n[SWS_BswM_00041]\n[SRS_BSW_00323]\nAll AUTOSAR Basic Software\nModules shall check passed API\nparameters for validity\n[SWS_BswM_00321] [SWS_BswM_00322]\n[SWS_BswM_00323] [SWS_BswM_00324]\n[SRS_BSW_00336]\nBasic SW module shall be able to\nshutdown\n[SWS_BswM_00119] [SWS_BswM_00120]\n[SRS_BSW_00344]\nBSW Modules shall support link-time\nconfiguration\n[SWS_BswM_00002]\n[SRS_BSW_00358]\nThe return type of init() functions\nimplemented by AUTOSAR Basic\nSoftware Modules shall be void\n[SWS_BswM_00002]\n[SRS_BSW_00373]\nThe main processing function of each\nAUTOSAR Basic Software Module\nshall be named according the defined\nconvention\n[SWS_BswM_00053]\n[SRS_BSW_00384]\nThe Basic Software Module\nspecifications shall specify at least in\nthe description which other modules\nthey require\n[SWS_BswM_00007] [SWS_BswM_00008]\n[SRS_BSW_00385]\nList possible error notifications\n[SWS_BswM_00230]\n[SRS_BSW_00404]\nBSW Modules shall support\npost-build configuration\n[SWS_BswM_00002] [SWS_BswM_00042]\n[SWS_BswM_00213]…","caption":"6 Requirements Tracing","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWM_SECTION_6_Requirements_Tracing","releases":["R23-11"],"page":22,"hash":"030ca313fee87990","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/6a2249dc8269/page_22.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWM_SECTION_6_Requirements_Tracing","releases":["R24-11"],"page":22,"hash":"48b2b24a4c971e5a","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/a6ce38abd020/page_22.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWM_SECTION_6_Requirements_Tracing","releases":["R25-11"],"page":22,"hash":"9d0524b8b5961faf","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/9b42f66497d8/page_22.webp"}],"releases":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/9b42f66497d8/page_22.webp","trel":"R25-11","tstat":"section","kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.98,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Explizite Erwähnung von SWS_BswM_00002 im Text des Dokuments AUTOSAR_CP_SWS_BSWModeManager.pdf.","rel":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"id":"SWS_BswM_00002"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.98,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Explizite Erwähnung von SWS_BswM_00003 im Text des Dokuments AUTOSAR_CP_SWS_BSWModeManager.pdf.","rel":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"id":"SWS_BswM_00003"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.98,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Explizite Erwähnung von SWS_BswM_00046 im Text des Dokuments AUTOSAR_CP_SWS_BSWModeManager.pdf.","rel":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"id":"SWS_BswM_00046"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.98,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Explizite Erwähnung von SWS_BswM_00047 im Text des Dokuments AUTOSAR_CP_SWS_BSWModeManager.pdf.","rel":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"id":"SWS_BswM_00047"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":